<https://hdl.handle.net/10665/332098> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "This is the style guide for WPRO publications and information products. All designers working on WHO WPRO publication and information products should use this as reference for design and layout. Templates and further guidelines are also available. For more information on WPRO publications guidelines, please contact wpropuballstaff@who.int"@en <https://iris.who.int/graph/metadata> .
